msgstr ""
"Berichterstattung stoppen und verknüpfte Nutzungs- und Lebenszyklusberichte "
"löschen"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:257
msgid "Preview the summary fields (installation credentials hidden)"
msgstr "Zusammenfassungsfelder ansehen (Installationszugangsdaten verborgen)"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:258
msgid "Help shape the next improvements"
msgstr "Gestalte die nächsten Verbesserungen mit"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:259
msgid ""
"Tell us what would help you. Feedback is optional; leave out passwords and "
"confidential information."
msgstr ""
"Sag uns, was dir helfen würde. Feedback ist freiwillig; lasse Passwörter und"
" vertrauliche Informationen weg."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:260
msgid "How your feedback is used"
msgstr "So wird dein Feedback genutzt"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:261
msgid ""
"Tell us the problem you want to solve. We use responses to prioritize future"
" improvements; we cannot promise a feature or release date. Please leave out"
" passwords and confidential client information."
msgstr ""
"Beschreibe dein Problem. Antworten helfen uns, Verbesserungen zu "
"priorisieren; wir können weder Funktionen noch Termine versprechen. Lasse "
"Passwörter und vertrauliche Kundendaten weg."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:262
msgid ""
"Submitted survey answers are retained for 180 days. Providing feedback is "
"optional and does not subscribe you to marketing."
